{"text":"kuruntokai","n":30,"lines":["கேட்டிசின் வாழி தோழி அல்கற்","பொய்வ லாளன் மெய்யுறல் மரீஇய","வாய்த்தகைப் பொய்க்கனா மருட்ட ஏற்றெழுந்து","அமளி தைவந் தனனே குவளை","வண்டுபடு மலரிற் சாஅய்த்","தமியேன் மன்ற அளியேன் யானே"],"tr":["kēṭṭiciṉ vāḻi tōḻi alkaṟ","poyva lāḷaṉ meyyuṟal marīiya","vāyttakaip poykkaṉā maruṭṭa ēṟṟeḻuntu","amaḷi taivan taṉaṉē kuvaḷai","vaṇṭupaṭu malariṟ cāayt","tamiyēṉ maṉṟa aḷiyēṉ yāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கச்சிப்பேட்டு நன்னாகையார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kaccippēṭṭu Naṉṉākaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"6 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"5×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 21, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 13, veṇṭaḷai 7, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கேட்டிசின்","tr":"kēṭṭiciṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கேட்","tr":"kēṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிசின்","tr":"ṭiciṉ"}]},{"text":"வாழி","tr":"vāḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"அல்கற்","tr":"alkaṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அல்","tr":"al"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கற்","tr":"kaṟ"}]}],[{"text":"பொய்வ","tr":"poyva","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொய்","tr":"poy"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வ","tr":"va"}]},{"text":"லாளன்","tr":"lāḷaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளன்","tr":"ḷaṉ"}]},{"text":"மெய்யுறல்","tr":"meyyuṟal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மெய்","tr":"mey"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுறல்","tr":"yuṟal"}]},{"text":"மரீஇய","tr":"marīiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரீ","tr":"marī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இய","tr":"iya"}]}],[{"text":"வாய்த்தகைப்","tr":"vāyttakaip","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாய்த்","tr":"vāyt"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தகைப்","tr":"takaip"}]},{"text":"பொய்க்கனா","tr":"poykkaṉā","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொய்க்","tr":"poyk"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கனா","tr":"kaṉā"}]},{"text":"மருட்ட","tr":"maruṭṭa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மருட்","tr":"maruṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"ஏற்றெழுந்து","tr":"ēṟṟeḻuntu","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஏற்","tr":"ēṟ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றெழுந்","tr":"ṟeḻun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"அமளி","tr":"amaḷi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அம","tr":"ama"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளி","tr":"ḷi"}]},{"text":"தைவந்","tr":"taivan","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வந்","tr":"van"}]},{"text":"தனனே","tr":"taṉaṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]},{"text":"குவளை","tr":"kuvaḷai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவ","tr":"kuva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளை","tr":"ḷai"}]}],[{"text":"வண்டுபடு","tr":"vaṇṭupaṭu","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வண்","tr":"vaṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுப","tr":"ṭupa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]},{"text":"மலரிற்","tr":"malariṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மல","tr":"mala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரிற்","tr":"riṟ"}]},{"text":"சாஅய்த்","tr":"cāayt","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சா","tr":"cā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அய்த்","tr":"ayt"}]}],[{"text":"தமியேன்","tr":"tamiyēṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தமி","tr":"tami"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யேன்","tr":"yēṉ"}]},{"text":"மன்ற","tr":"maṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"அளியேன்","tr":"aḷiyēṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அளி","tr":"aḷi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யேன்","tr":"yēṉ"}]},{"text":"யானே","tr":"yāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கேட்டிசின்","parts":[{"text":"கேள்","lemma":"kēḷ","gloss":"listen"},{"text":"திசின்","lemma":"ticiṉ","gloss":"imperative particle"}],"gloss":"listen!"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"vāḻi","gloss":"may you live long"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"அல்கல்","parts":[{"text":"அல்கல்","lemma":"alkal","gloss":"night"}],"gloss":"at night"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொய்வலாளன்","parts":[{"text":"பொய்","lemma":"poy","gloss":"lie"},{"text":"வல்","lemma":"val","gloss":"skillful"},{"text":"ஆளன்","lemma":"āḷaṉ","gloss":"man"}],"gloss":"the man skilled in lies"},{"surface":"மெய்யுறல்","parts":[{"text":"மெய்","lemma":"mey","gloss":"body"},{"text":"உறல்","lemma":"uṟal","gloss":"embracing"}],"gloss":"embracing the body"},{"surface":"மரீஇய","parts":[{"text":"மரீஇய","lemma":"marīiya","gloss":"accustomed to"}],"gloss":"accustomed to"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாய்த்தகை","parts":[{"text":"வாய்மை","lemma":"vāymai","gloss":"truth"},{"text":"தகை","lemma":"takai","gloss":"nature"}],"gloss":"having the appearance of truth"},{"surface":"பொய்க்கனா","parts":[{"text":"பொய்","lemma":"poy","gloss":"false"},{"text":"கனா","lemma":"kaṉā","gloss":"dream"}],"gloss":"false dream"},{"surface":"மருட்ட","parts":[{"text":"மருட்ட","lemma":"maruṭṭa","gloss":"to delude"}],"gloss":"having deluded"},{"surface":"ஏற்றெழுந்து","parts":[{"text":"ஏற்று","lemma":"ēṟṟu","gloss":"eagerly"},{"text":"எழுந்து","lemma":"eḻuntu","gloss":"rising"}],"gloss":"rising up eagerly"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அமளி","parts":[{"text":"அமளி","lemma":"amaḷi","gloss":"bed"}],"gloss":"bed"},{"surface":"தைவந்தனனே","parts":[{"text":"தைவந்தனனே","lemma":"தைவந்தனனே","gloss":"I caressed"}],"gloss":"I caressed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குவளை","parts":[{"text":"குவளை","lemma":"kuvaḷai","gloss":"blue water-lily"}],"gloss":"blue water-lily"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வண்டுபடு","parts":[{"text":"வண்டு","lemma":"vaṇṭu","gloss":"bee"},{"text":"படு","lemma":"paṭu","gloss":"landing"}],"gloss":"where bees land"},{"surface":"மலரின்","parts":[{"text":"மலர்","lemma":"malar","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like a flower"},{"surface":"சாஅய்","parts":[{"text":"சாஅய்","lemma":"cāay","gloss":"having withered"}],"gloss":"having withered"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தமியேன்","parts":[{"text":"தமியேன்","lemma":"tamiyēṉ","gloss":"I who am alone"}],"gloss":"I who am alone"},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"maṉṟa","gloss":"surely"}],"gloss":"surely"},{"surface":"அளியேன்","parts":[{"text":"அளியேன்","lemma":"aḷiyēṉ","gloss":"I who am pitiable"}],"gloss":"I who am pitiable"},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"yāṉ","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"myself"}]}],"literal":"Listen, may you live, O friend! At night, / the man skilled in lies, accustomed to embracing my body, / a false dream with the appearance of truth having deluded me, rising up eagerly, / I caressed the bed. Like a blue water-lily / flower on which bees land, having withered, / I am alone, surely, pitiable am I!","translation":"Listen, my friend, and may you live long! Last night, a false dream that seemed so real deluded me. It made me feel the embrace of that man so skilled in lies. Eagerly rising up, I stroked the bed only to find it empty. Now, like a blue water-lily crushed by visiting bees, I have withered. Surely, I am all alone, and so pitiable!","modern":"தோழியே! என் சொல்லைக் கேள், நீ டூழி வாழ்க! நேற்றிரவு, பொய் சொல்வதில் வல்லவனான என் தலைவன் என் உடலைத் தழுவுவது போன்ற ஒரு கனவு கண்டேன். உண்மையானது போலத் தோன்றிய அந்தப் பொய்க் கனவு என்னை ஏமாற்றியது. நான் ஆசையோடு விழித்தெழுந்து படுக்கையைத் தடவிப் பார்த்தேன். அங்கே அவன் இல்லை. வண்டுகள் மொய்த்த குவளை மலர் வாடிப் போவது போல என் உடல் வாடிப் போயிற்று. நான் தனியாகவும் மிகவும் இரங்கத்தக்கவளாகவும் ஆகிவிட்டேன்.","explanation":"The heroine (talaivi) is speaking to her close friend (tōḻi) during her separation from her lover. She describes a vivid dream she had during the night where her lover, whom she calls 'the man skilled in lies' due to his unkept promises, returned and embraced her. The dream was so realistic that she woke up in excitement and reached out to touch him on the bed, only to find it empty. This cruel disappointment leaves her completely withered, a state she compares to a blue water-lily (kuvaḷai) that has faded after being repeatedly visited and crushed by bees. The contrast between the warmth of the dream-embrace and the cold reality of the empty bed highlights her deep loneliness and grief in his absence.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,1.7],[1.7,1.7],[1.7,1.9],[1.9,4.4],[4.4,5.7],[5.7,5.7],[5.7,5.7],[5.7,7.9],[7.9,8.2],[8.2,9.1],[9.1,10.4],[10.4,10.5],[10.5,12.4],[12.4,12.4],[12.4,13.08],[13.08,14.3],[14.3,14.9],[14.9,15.3],[15.3,15.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.9],[1.9,3.3],[3.3,3.3],[3.3,4.3],[4.4,4.7],[4.7,6.45],[6.5,6.92],[6.92,7.08],[7.4,8.1],[8.1,8.43],[8.43,9.4],[9.4,10.4],[10.4,10.5],[10.5,12.5],[12.5,12.5],[12.65,13.4],[13.4,14.6],[14.6,15.1],[15.1,15.5],[15.5,15.7]]},"sync":[[["கேட்டிசின்","listen!"]],[["வாழி","may you live long"]],[["தோழி","O friend"]],[["அல்கல்","at night"]],[["பொய்வலாளன்","the man skilled in lies"]],[["பொய்வலாளன்","the man skilled in lies"]],[["மெய்யுறல்","embracing the body"]],[["மரீஇய","accustomed to"]],[["வாய்த்தகை","having the appearance of truth"]],[["பொய்க்கனா","false dream"]],[["மருட்ட","having deluded"]],[["ஏற்றெழுந்து","rising up eagerly"]],[["அமளி","bed"]],[["தைவந்தனனே","I caressed"]],[["தைவந்தனனே","I caressed"]],[["குவளை","blue water-lily"]],[["வண்டுபடு","where bees land"]],[["மலரின்","like a flower"]],[["சாஅய்","having withered"]],[["தமியேன்","I who am alone"]],[["மன்ற","surely"]],[["அளியேன்","I who am pitiable"]],[["யானே","myself"]]]}